# in.npt_stability -- Stage D worker fragment: NPT production MD.
#
# NOT standalone-runnable -- see in.nvt_stability's header for why (same
# pair_style mliap unified EXISTS / Python-side model-load requirement;
# verified empirically 2026-08-19, not assumed).
#
# Intended to run via lmp.file() immediately after in.nvt_stability, in the
# SAME lammps.lammps() process/instance, continuing in-memory from the NVT
# run's final positions/velocities/box -- deliberately no re-read_data and
# no re-velocity-create, so NPT starts from an already-thermalized state
# rather than a cold restart.
#
# `tri` couples all 6 stress components (Pxx,Pyy,Pzz,Pyz,Pxz,Pxy) to the
# SAME target pressure, each with independent barostat dynamics -- i.e. a
# fully flexible triclinic barostat, deliberately NOT `iso`/`aniso` (which
# would hold the box angles fixed). Monitoring the alpha angle / yz shear
# response under load is the explicit purpose of this run: Al3Ni5 has this
# model's softest shear constant (C44=33.15 GPa, ~3x softer than its own
# C55/C66 and every other phase's shear constants -- see
# configs/LAMMPS_STAGE_C_ELASTIC_STATUS.txt), and C44 is precisely the yz/
# alpha-tilt mode. A barostat that could not move the angle would silently
# hide the risk this run exists to check for.
#
# Driver must set/reuse these LAMMPS variables before lmp.file()'ing this
# script (temp/tdamp typically reused unchanged from the NVT stage):
#   temp          target temperature, K
#   tdamp         Nose-Hoover thermostat damping time, ps
#   pressure      target external pressure, bar (0.0 = ambient)
#   pdamp         barostat damping time, ps
#   npt_steps     number of 1-fs steps to run
#   thermo_every  thermo/log sampling interval, steps (reused from NVT)
#   final_data    path to write the post-NPT LAMMPS data file (provenance)

thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal press pxx pyy pzz pxy pxz pyz lx ly lz xy xz yz vol
thermo_modify flush yes

print "=== STAGE D NPT PRODUCTION START ==="
fix mdintegrate all npt temp ${temp} ${temp} ${tdamp} tri ${pressure} ${pressure} ${pdamp}
run ${npt_steps}
print "=== STAGE D NPT PRODUCTION END ==="
unfix mdintegrate

write_data ${final_data} nocoeff
